02:10:36.299 --> 02:10:37.899
<v Wolfgang>wenn man jetzt von außen drauf blickt.

02:10:40.339 --> 02:10:43.539
<v Clips>Between what happens inside a society

02:10:43.539 --> 02:10:52.419
<v Clips>or in domestic politics on one hand and the international system on the other

02:10:52.419 --> 02:11:00.959
<v Clips>hand is that inside a society you have a higher authority that you can turn to for protection.

02:11:01.299 --> 02:11:06.179
